.\" ###### Setup ############################################################
.Dd October 13, 2026
.Dt Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys 1
.Os Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys
.\" ###### Name #############################################################
.Sh NAME
.Nm Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys
.Nd prints SSH key fingerprints
.\" ###### Synopsis #########################################################
.\" Manpage syntax help:
.\" https://forums.freebsd.org/threads/howto-create-a-manpage-from-scratch.13200/
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys
.Op Fl A | Fl Fl all
.Op Fl a | Fl Fl none
.br
.Op Fl R | Fl Fl with\-raw
.Op Fl r | Fl Fl without\-raw
.br
.Op Fl D | Fl Fl with\-dns
.Op Fl d | Fl Fl without\-dns
.br
.Op Fl S | Fl Fl with\-ssh
.Op Fl s | Fl Fl without\-ssh
.br
.Op Fl F Ar type | Fl Fl format Ar type
.br
.Op Fl K Ar directory | Fl Fl key\-directory Ar directory
.br
.Op Fl Fl include\-deprecated
.Nm Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys
.Op Fl h | Fl Fl help
.Nm Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys
.Op Fl v | Fl Fl version
.\" ###### Description ######################################################
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys
prints the SSH host key fingerprints and records of the local machine.
Output can be selected for:
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
Raw public keys
.It
SSH hash format
.It
DNS SSHFP RR format
.El
.Pp
Each output can be formatted as plain text, Python data structures, or CSV.
By default, SSH and DNS formats are enabled using plain text.
.\" ###### Arguments ########################################################
.Sh ARGUMENTS
The following options are available:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl A | Fl Fl all
Enable all outputs (raw, ssh, and dns).
.It Fl a | Fl Fl none
Disable all outputs.
.It Fl R | Fl Fl with\-raw
Include raw public keys in the output.
.It Fl r | Fl Fl without\-raw
Exclude raw public keys from the output.
.It Fl D | Fl Fl with\-dns
Include DNS SSHFP resource records in the output.
.It Fl d | Fl Fl without\-dns
Exclude DNS SSHFP resource records from the output.
.It Fl S | Fl Fl with\-ssh
Include SSH key fingerprints in the output.
.It Fl s | Fl Fl without\-ssh
Exclude SSH key fingerprints from the output.
.It Fl F Ar type | Fl Fl format Ar type
Set output format
.Ar type
to one of
.Cm text
(default),
.Cm python ,
or
.Cm csv .
.It Fl K Ar directory | Fl Fl key\-directory Ar directory
Specify the directory containing the SSH host public keys (defaults to
.Pa /etc/ssh
or Windows
.Pa %PROGRAMDATA%/ssh ) .
.It Fl Fl include\-deprecated
Also include deprecated key types and hash algorithms in DNS SSHFP RR output.
.It Fl h | Fl Fl help
Prints the program's command\-line parameters and exits.
.It Fl v | Fl Fl version
Prints the program version and exits.
.El
.\" ###### Exit status ######################################################
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The
.Nm
tool exits with 0 on success, and >0 in case of an error.
.\" ###### Examples #########################################################
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys
Prints SSH fingerprints and DNS records in text format.
.It Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys \-A \-F csv
Prints raw keys, SSH fingerprints, and DNS records in CSV format.
.It Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys \-aS \-F python
Prints only SSH fingerprints formatted as a Python dictionary.
.It Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys \-K /path/to/keys \-R
Prints default formats plus raw keys from a custom key directory.
.It Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys \-\-include\-deprecated
Prints fingerprints including deprecated DNS SSHFP records.
.It Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys \-\-version
Prints the program version.
.It Fingerprint\-SSH\-Keys \-\-help
Displays usage instructions.
.El
